    "statement": "\u2200 {D : Type u_2} [inst : Fintype D] (w g : D \u2192 \u211d),\n  (\u2200 (d : D), 0 \u2264 w d) \u2192\n    \u2200 (a : \u211d),\n      \u2211 d, w d * (g d - a) ^ 2 =\n        OAI.ContingencyTables.FiniteExposureVariance.variance w g +\n          (\u2211 d, w d) * (OAI.ContingencyTables.FiniteExposureVariance.mean w g - a) ^ 2"
